ng a Sophanem slayer dungeon drop enhancer ."}}},{["name"]="Khopesh of the Kharidian",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/3,000 on task; 1/15,000 off task",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/3,000 on task; 1/15,000 off task",["notes"]="Base rates; Slayer-task status matters.",["condition"]="Base rates, 23 November 2026"}},["rateSource"]="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/patch-notes-late-game-rebalance"},{["name"]="Corrupted gem",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/2,000 on task",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/2,000 on task",["notes"]="Slayer tasks only.",["condition"]="Base rates, 23 November 2026"}},["rateSource"]="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/patch-notes-late-game-rebalance"},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #1",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 625 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 1,249 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #2",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 1,875 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 2,499 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #3",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 3,125 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 3,749 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #4",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 4,375 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 4,999 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #5",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/625 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 5,625 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 6,249 kills."}}},{["name"]="Sealed clue scroll (hard)",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/256",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/256",["section"]="Tertiary"}}},{["name"]="Starved ancient effigy",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/14,876 – 1/74,380",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/14,876 – 1/74,380",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="Only dropped if fewer than five ancient effigies are owned. The drop rate is decreased for every effigy owned, up to four effigies."}}},{["name"]="Spirit sapphire",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="5/2,000",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]