 be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 2,750 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 3,299 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #4",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/550 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/550 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 3,850 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 4,399 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #5",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/550 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/550 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 4,950 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 5,499 kills."}}},{["name"]="Sealed clue scroll (hard)",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/256",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/256",["section"]="Tertiary"}}},{["name"]="Starved ancient effigy",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/14,349 – 1/71,747",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/14,349 – 1/71,747",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="Only dropped if fewer than five ancient effigies are owned. The drop rate is decreased for every effigy owned, up to four effigies."}}},{["name"]="Spirit sapphire",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="5/2,000",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="5/2,000",["section